 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **View-Inconsistency:** The DDF is 5D (position + direction). Depth-rendering the same field from different viewpoints can produce incompatible geometries if the field is not properly constrained to be View Consistent (VC) [S1, Parent].
-*   **Precision:** The visibility field $\xi$ uses a threshold (0.5) to determine intersection. Numerical instability near $\xi=0.5$ may cause flickering or missed bounces [S1].
