 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Linear in the number of bounces. Each bounce requires one or two DDF queries (forward and backward) and BRDF evaluation.
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Depends on the storage of the DDF and INRs for appearance/lighting. No large buffers are required compared to rasterization.
